#What I Have Used
-Jetson Orin Nano Developer Kit 
-Power Supply for Jetson Orin Nano(19 V)
-UHS-1 SD card (preferably 64gb or greater)
-NVMe SSD (Recommended but you can use SD card as well)
-A Laptop or PC (Linux, Mac or Windows)
-Jumper cap (if not available you can use a paperclip or any small metalclip)
